on to the Vehicle.","ar":"هذه الوحدة الأولى، مقدّمة إلى المركبة."},"id":"L002"},{"actor":"maher","start":7.99,"text":{"en":"This is Part 6, Writing.","ar":"هذا الجزء السادس، الكتابة."},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"maher","start":11.028,"text":{"en":"Watch what each sentence does.","ar":"شاهد ما تفعله كلّ جملة."},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"maher","start":13.946,"text":{"en":"Part 6 asks you to describe your job, or a car.","ar":"الجزء السادس يطلب منك أن تصف عملك أو سيارة."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"maher","start":18.232,"text":{"en":"Use fifty to seventy words.","ar":"استخدم من خمسين إلى سبعين كلمة."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"maher","start":21.438,"text":{"en":"Here is a model I wrote from the book's plan.","ar":"هذا نموذج كتبته من خطّة الكتاب."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"maher","start":24.956,"text":{"en":"I am a mechanic at Cham Motors.","ar":"أنا ميكانيكي في شام موتورز."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"maher","start":28.186,"text":{"en":"The first sentence says who I am.","ar":"الجملة الأولى تقول من أنا."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"maher","start":31.296,"text":{"en":"Every day, I service five or six cars.","ar":"كلّ يوم، أصون خمس أو ستّ سيارات."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"maher","start":35.054,"text":{"en":"Every day, I service cars. Which tense is this?","ar":"كلّ يوم، أصون السيارات. أيّ زمن هذا؟"},"subHold":10.685,"id":"L011"},{"actor":"maher","start":45.739,"text":{"en":"The present simple. It is a routine.","ar":"المضارع البسيط. إنّه عمل يومي."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"maher","start":50.241,"text":{"en":"First, I read the job card.","ar":"أوّلاً، أقرأ بطاقة العمل."},"id":"L013"},{"actor":"maher","start":53.423,"text":{"en":"Then I check the engine, the battery and the tyres.","ar":"ثمّ أفحص المحرّك والبطارية والإطارات."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"maher","start":57.565,"text":{"en":"First and then put the steps in order.","ar":"«أوّلاً» و«ثمّ» ترتّبان الخطوات."},"id":"L015"},{"actor":"maher","start":61.035,"text":{"en":"Right now, I am changing the oil in a small car.","ar":"الآن، أغيّر الزيت في سيارة صغيرة."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"maher","start":65.129,"text":{"en":"Right now, I am changing the oil. Which tense is this?","ar":"الآن، أغيّر الزيت. أيّ زمن هذا؟"},"subHold":11.24,"id":"L017"},{"actor":"maher","start":76.369,"text":{"en":"The present continuous. It is happening now.","ar":"المضارع المستمر. يحدث الآن."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"maher","start":81.375,"text":{"en":"I like my job because I help people every day.","ar":"أحبّ عملي لأنّي أساعد الناس كلّ يوم."},"id":"L019"},{"actor":"maher","start":85.253,"text":{"en":"Which word gives the reason?","ar":"أيّ كلمة تعطي السبب؟"},"subHold":7.023,"id":"L020"},{"actor":"maher","start":92.276,"text":{"en":"Because.","ar":"لأنّ (because)."},"id":"L021"},{"actor":"maher","start":94.354,"text":{"en":"That is fifty-one words, with one routine and one sentence about now.","ar":"هذه إحدى وخمسون كلمة، فيها عمل يومي وجملة عن الآن."},"id":"L022"},{"actor":"maher","start":99.432,"text":{"en":"Now it is your turn.","ar":"الآن دورك."},"id":"L023"},{"actor":"maher","start":101.966,"text":{"en":"Pause the video, and write about your job or a car.","ar":"أوقف الفيديو، واكتب عن عملك أو عن سيارة."},"id":"L024"},{"actor":"maher","start":106.156,"text":{"en":"The book has three more tasks for you.","ar":"في الكتاب ثلاث مهامّ أخرى لك."},"id":"L025"},{"actor":"maher","start":109.506,"text":{"en":"Why good servicing matters, a note to the mechanic, and a car in your family.","ar":"لماذا الصيانة الجيّدة مهمّة، ورسالة إلى الميكانيكي، وسيارة في عائلتك."},"id":"L026"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"d151f5932f8958b3","bytes":19296,"sha":"dfbb827359f21582","address":"lines/d151f5932f8958b3.mp3"},{"key":"f1c2ccfa9de7d37e","bytes":21744,"sha":"efc2fd8f1a9a102d","address":"lines/f1c2ccfa9de7d37e.mp3"},{"key":"330d8a10feb9e177","bytes":16128,"sha":"030c589118aa9c01","address":"lines/330d8a10feb9e177